{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0043_1000_009rit", "source_sha256": "0b363c9e6dc782f8d7808f8409c34f3e93b32d552ccdd571c68082681753627e", "ja": "お疲れ様です、{$P$}。\n今回は、なかなか夢のある仕事でしたね。", "zh": "工作辛苦了，{$P$}。\n这次的工作真是充满梦想呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0043_1001_009rit", "source_sha256": "6b33d5cabec91f6ce2b113c215640fd02e81d6edb3a4060b408125a534e5e1c1", "ja": "宇宙に行ったり、未来に行ったり。\nふふっ、楽しませてもらいました♪", "zh": "又是上太空、又是穿越未来的。\n呵呵，我很乐在其中喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0043_1002_p", "source_sha256": "a5bf209c1eedc3b267b88ab6976be639a55b48da9d0d7d239a9801903877f29c", "ja": "それは何よりだ。\n律子はSFとか、好きなのか？", "zh": "那真是太好了。\n律子喜欢科幻作品吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0043_1003_009rit", "source_sha256": "6d1e866b6283321de756ee3ea1cff80c4fdc2c86724f6c94e97c9a8ce785fc59", "ja": "そうですね、人並みには。設定がしっかりしてる\nものほど、読み応えがありますし。", "zh": "这个嘛，普通吧。\n设定越是严谨的作品，读起来就让人越起劲嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0043_1004_p", "source_sha256": "09aa350153e626c65c26479016f32a01bb718395d82222e0163dab0a09578a11", "ja": "（……人並み以上に好きそうだな）", "zh": "（……看来她喜欢的程度不只是普通而已。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0043_1005_009rit", "source_sha256": "74b559c9b054296da52f817b8cd97630fa721297a5e8b3d2a99aef48904031c4", "ja": "そうだ、うちの劇場からも、誰か売り出しません？\nSFアイドル！", "zh": "对了，我们剧场要不要也推出一个\n科幻偶像呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0043_1006_009rit", "source_sha256": "2e2c7984d2475383107ea7f44ab6f89ae35e09a23bd38342589d255a06d0673c", "ja": "設定は百合子あたりに考えてもらって……ファンタジー\n系の方が得意そうだけど、なんとかなるでしょ♪", "zh": "设定就请百合子她们来想……\n虽然她好像比较熟悉奇幻类的，不过应该能搞定吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0043_1007_009rit", "source_sha256": "94cb67034d4f9e95e141aa3005cb015db6ada5376f9132f0a32cc808c099c461", "ja": "売り出すのは、サイバーな衣装が似合う子が\nいいですよね。麗花さんとかどうです？", "zh": "要推的话，要找个适合近未来风服装的人选吧。\n丽花应该不错吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0043_1008_p", "source_sha256": "78ed79e1bfe655ac0691200d382be2893871e1142053596db6c4d2ea91a31083", "ja": "そこは遠慮しないで、律子が立候補すれば\nいいんじゃないか？　発案者なんだし。", "zh": "这种时候不用客气，律子毛遂自荐不就行了吗？\n毕竟是你的提议嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0043_1009_009rit", "source_sha256": "d203e245b7fcbe5c1f105600ca4c97229046b04c0556e9f5d56c0ad920ae4883", "ja": "え？　うーん、私はエンジニア役とかの方が、\n似合うんじゃないかなぁ。ほら、白衣とか着たりして！", "zh": "什么？嗯～但我应该比较适合工程师的角色吧？\n你想像一下，穿白袍的那种啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0043_1010_009rit", "source_sha256": "cfddb8728ae277e30892fde6ded9648181b70ca32a218b0da2a43e84e94fbe22", "ja": "ただ、そういう役って、だいたい中盤あたりで\nいなくなるんですよね。主に宇宙に放り出されて。", "zh": "不过，这种角色大多在故事中段就退场了。\n主要都是被丢到太空中。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0043_1011_p", "source_sha256": "362482dcda796fae29725bceb9f491d314aefd81e4c5556e259af5f12db9e057", "ja": "な、なるほど……。でも、もしかしたら、\nヒーローが助けに来るかもしれないじゃないか。", "zh": "这、这样啊……可是，\n说不定主角会来救你啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0043_1012_009rit", "source_sha256": "5942fda0f93825359285ce0a5c00b5e6665e6b0d700e39420e740d35b66c38cc", "ja": "え？　ヒーローが、ですか？", "zh": "什么？你说主角吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0043_1013_p", "source_sha256": "ece2fd5d409be08ef18c9b0435f8eaaba81323c6fa50d41b1ed7379ecd759fd6", "ja": "うん。孤独の中で息絶える寸前、決してあきらめない\nヒーローに助けられる……。", "zh": "嗯，当你差点独自在太空中断气时，\n绝不轻言放弃的主角现身拯救你……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0043_1014_p", "source_sha256": "b557f0842c48e1011a72848006dc9c356a33c398e692859b41c5372e66f828f3", "ja": "ほら、これで律子も、\n立派なメインヒロインだ。", "zh": "这样一来，\n律子就是最佳女主角了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0043_1016_p", "source_sha256": "7dfeb7fa16de01817deec998ae957b5b3e43ef7783a8c320e534fc5242c2d96f", "ja": "あ、面白くないか？", "zh": "啊，这情节不好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0043_1017_009rit", "source_sha256": "5ea85a373489f6cfa73acc6a5def0b025cd77736e482089f22ca2a912c8661a6", "ja": "う、ううん、いいと思います！　ふふっ、意外と\n脚本のセンスもあったりするんじゃないですか？", "zh": "不、不会啊，我觉得很棒！\n呵呵，其实你可能挺适合写剧本的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0043_1018_009rit", "source_sha256": "f09130536dad59fe9ea8623ec986745912a11a7613c6d0d071fc50c898df63c4", "ja": "せっかくだから、企画書でも書いてみようかなぁ。\n乗りかかった船ってことで、協力してくださいね♪", "zh": "既然都想好了，我就来写份企划书吧。\n事情不能做半套，请你也要协助到底喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0043_1019_p", "source_sha256": "0669bcea4350dfe8aba4b1af837bbad424bd46314c2d7a48992f354980aa10c6", "ja": "（ちょっとした思いつきから、夢がふくらんでいる。\nたまには、こんなプロデュースも悪くないな）", "zh": "（从小小的突发奇想，扩大成无限的想像。\n偶尔采用这样的培育方式也不错呢。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
